  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A Stable Diffusion landscape of a red roofed house among broad flat topped trees above waterfalls and rocky slopes, with a wide lake and mountains behind.",
    "description": "A square generated image in a painterly style. A large wide lake with sandbars stretches across the middle under bluish mountains and white clouds. In the middle distance, a two storey house with a red roof sits among tall trees with broad, flat, layered canopies like umbrella pines. Below it, a stream tumbles down in a series of white waterfalls at left, and the foreground is a slope of orange and pink rock, mossy ground and red flowering shrubs at lower left. Tall trees frame both edges.",
    "impression": "The most recognisable ancestor of the finished piece: the red roofed house under a tall tree, the waterfall at left and the red flowers at the bottom all survive into the 2023 drawing. It feels like a found composition that the hand drawing then took apart and rebuilt.",
